  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the garlic powder, turmeric powder, cumin powder, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chopped parsley, chopped cilantro, and kimchi, and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the almond flour, water, and dried apricots (if using), and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 20-25 minutes, or until the tagine has thickened and the flavors have melded together.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with additional chopped herbs if desired."
